#: ../../source/docs/crash-detect.rst:4 c433ddfc1cd842b5bd6745260965db04
msgid "Crash Detection"
msgstr "坠机检测"

#: ../../source/docs/crash-detect.rst:6 588d416f67ad42b6b8224ddc89474cec
msgid ""
"Plane provides a means to disarm the motors if a crash is detected. This is "
"provided only in AUTO mode and checks for sudden deceleration in the X axis "
"(front/back)."
msgstr "固定翼提供了一种在检测到坠机时上锁电机的功能。该功能仅在 Auto 模式下启用，并检测 X 轴（前/后方向）的突然减速。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash-detect.rst:9 7a46aba93a68483f9c65050a6ab59d14
msgid "Detection Threshold"
msgstr "检测阈值"

#: ../../source/docs/crash-detect.rst:11 b02cba9af3a74244ac9a86f5154a9573
msgid ""
":ref:`CRASH_ACC_THRESH<CRASH_ACC_THRESH>` set the X-Axis deceleration "
"threshold to notify the crash detector that there was a possible impact "
"which helps disarm the motor quickly after a crash. This value should be "
"much higher than normal negative x-axis forces during normal flight, check "
"flight log files to determine the average IMU.x values for your aircraft and"
" motor type. Higher value means less sensitive (triggers on higher impact). "
"For electric planes that don’t vibrate much during fight a value of 25 is "
"good (that’s about 2.5G). For petrol/nitro planes you’ll want a higher "
"value. Set to 0 to disable the collision detector."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CRASH_ACC_THRESH<CRASH_ACC_THRESH>` 设置 X "
"轴减速阈值，以通知坠机检测器发生了可能的撞击，从而在坠机后迅速上锁电机。该值应远高于正常飞行中的负 X "
"轴力，请检查飞行日志文件以确定您的飞机和电机类型的平均 IMU.x 值。值越高表示灵敏度越低（在更强撞击时触发）。对于飞行中振动较小的电动飞机，25 "
"是一个合适的值（约 2.5G）。对于汽油/硝基飞机，您需要更高的值。设置为 0 可禁用碰撞检测器。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash-detect.rst:14 9eb672a8f1d745dd8440dc03c922e6ac
msgid "Enabling the Detection"
msgstr "启用检测"

#: ../../source/docs/crash-detect.rst:16 55ed7d8006954d3fa7c2370942aa01b9
msgid ""
"Setting bit 1 of the :ref:`CRASH_DETECT<CRASH_DETECT>` parameter enables "
"disarming the Plane when :ref:`CRASH_ACC_THRESH<CRASH_ACC_THRESH>` has been "
"exceeded."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`CRASH_DETECT<CRASH_DETECT>` 参数的第 1 位设置为 1，可在超过 "
":ref:`CRASH_ACC_THRESH<CRASH_ACC_THRESH>` 时上锁固定翼。"
